  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 3301.01 Statement of Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to set fees for testing of domestic animals, upon the request of an animal owner or event organization, that are performed by employees of the division of animal industry of the department of agriculture, markets and food or any other approved agent.\n\nSource. #7285, eff 5-24-00, EXPIRED: 5-24-08\n\nNew. #9181, eff 6-13-08, EXPIRED: 6-13-16\n\nNew. #12678, eff 11-20-18",
